//RS //! D-DX-PREVIEW1=A: typed, source-identified preview/playground state for Canvas.
//RS //!
//RS //! This module owns only the bounded host state.  It does not parse source,
//RS //! evaluate a second UI tree, or invent a renderer.  A caller supplies the
//RS //! checked callback and the normal Canvas renderer through `evaluate` (or
//RS //! `publish` when the renderer is driven by the dev session).  The same
//RS //! `CanvasPreviewSession<T>` can therefore carry the canonical `UiNode` type
//RS //! without making this crate depend on the code generator.
